<title>USA: Missouri direct hogs up $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Missouri direct hogs up $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>JEFFERSON CITY 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were $0.50 higher than Tuesday's close. Top $53.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3  230-260 lbs    51.00-53.00, some 53.50</p>
<p>    US 2-3  260-270 lbs    50.00-51.00</p>
<p>		270-280 lbs    49.00-50.00</p>
<p>Sows - steady/off $1.00. Top $49.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-3    300-500 lbs    38.00-41.00</p>
<p>		  over 500 lbs    46.00-49.00</p>
</text>
